  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0E77">Definition <span data-tag="0E77">109.22.4</span>.</a> We denote $\overline{\mathcal{M}}$ and we name the <em>moduli stack of stable curves</em> the algebraic stack $\mathcal{C}\! \mathit{urves}^{stable}$ parametrizing stable families of curves introduced in Lemma <a href="/tag/0E76" data-tag="0E76">109.22.3</a>. For $g \geq 2$ we denote $\overline{\mathcal{M}}_ g$ and we name the <em>moduli stack of stable curves of genus $g$</em> the algebraic stack introduced in Lemma <a href="/tag/0E78" data-tag="0E78">109.22.5</a>. </p>
